# TASK 4: Mini-Project / Proposal

## Project Title: AI/ML Powered Computational Frameworks for Accelerated Biotechnology Research

### 1. Introduction
Biotechnology research mein modern DNA sequencing technology ke chalte biological data ka volume bohot tezi se barh raha hai. Is proposal ka maqsad Machine Learning (ML) algorithms ka istemal kar ke data analysis ki processing speed ko optimize karna aur patterns ko accurately predict karna hai.

### 2. Problem Statement
Traditional laboratory methods ke zariye high-throughput screening aur large genomic sequences ko manually analyze karne mein saal lag jate hain. Computational tools aur predictive modeling ke bagair big data se patterns extract karna nihayat costly aur process ko slow bana deta hai.

### 3. Objectives
* Research biological datasets ko speed up karne ke liye Python-based ML models utilize karna.
* Genetic mutations aur cellular structures ko accurately classify karne ke liye classification models banana.
* Wet-lab experiments ke expenses ko dry-lab computational simulations ke zariye kam karna.

### 4. Methodology & Expected Outcomes
* **Methodology:** NCBI database se open-source genomic data extract kiya jayega, use Pandas/NumPy se clean kar ke Random Forest aur Neural Networks ke models par train kiya jayega.
* **Expected Outcomes:** Ek high-accuracy computational tool jo data testing ki automated reporting generate kar sake aur research timeline ko reduce kare.

